        "id": "authoritative-real-token-counter", "status": "blocked",
        "reason": "A real ephemeral `codex exec` turn emitted input/output counts in `turn.completed.usage`, and a separate real ephemeral App Server turn emitted `thread/tokenUsage/updated`. Session Lens still has no supported subscription to the running desktop thread and has not received usage in its UI.",
